      "text": "Does anyone want to take a gander on what country was the first to have a digitalized voting system? What system did they use? Why did Kamala shift gears from this in 2019 to condemning DJT admin now for removing Madura? \n\n➡️ “What’s happening in Venezuela is a crisis. The people who have fled Maduro’s dictatorial regime deserve safety and protection. As President, I would immediately extend TPS status to Venezuelans. It’s the right thing to do. America must show moral leadership in this hemisphere,\" Kamala Harris posted in 2019” \n\nChavez, Madura… are results of a corrupt voting system. While Dominion nor Smartmatic was created in Venezuela, here is what I found… “The company, co-founded by Venezuelan engineers, has faced recent legal issues, including federal charges against former President Roger Piñate and other executives for alleged bribery in the Philippines. “ It is said that some of the US servers for the 28 states that used these machines in the 2020 election was located there. Madura held this over Biden’s head but now the canary will sing. \n\nIn my opinion, we haven’t seen the end of Madura. He will show up again before a grand jury. Maybe even a tribunal…. Why else would the Soros puppets and Democrats be pushing these protest in US cities? Revenge tour…. Happy New Year! 😉💥🗳️",
